{%- comment -%}
  PG Cart Mobile: the "Your Cart (n items)" bar stops sticking on phones.

  pg-drawer pins it with `.pg-cart-top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:6}`. On a
  phone the drawer is full-width and short, so that bar eats a permanent slice
  of the panel and rides over whatever scrolls beneath it -- in practice it sits
  on top of the "Add & Save More" heading.

  Below 760px it scrolls away with the rest of the list. It keeps its
  background, padding and bottom rule, so it still reads as the header of the
  panel; it simply is not pinned. Desktop keeps the sticky behaviour, where
  there is height to spare.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
@media (max-width:760px){
  #cart .pg-cart-top{
    position:static !important;
    top:auto !important;
    z-index:auto !important
  }
}
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name": "PG Cart Mobile", "settings": []}
{% endschema %}
